function s002c AppendNumber
	doc "Appends the number as `format` says (a letter and an optional precision, as in an AppendF placeholder {0:F2}): F fixed (2 decimals by default: F2), E or e scientific (6), G general (significant digits: 15, a float 7), N fixed with , between thousands (2 decimals, an integer 0), D decimal with at least that many digits, X or x hex and B binary with at least that many digits (D, X and B round a float to an integer; X and B of a negative integer give its 64-bit two's complement); an empty or unknown spec writes the plain form."
param value int
param format StringView
sheet body
node na01 Scope
	unsafe
node na02 Entry
node na03 Get this.mLength
node na04 Operator +
	in b 512
node na05 Call this.Reserve
